    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In February 2018, the AKU-SONAM campus in Nairobi, Kenya got licensed by the Commission of University Education to begin offering the Bachelor of Science in Midwifery course. This undergraduate, upskilling degree officially opened its doors at the beginning of August 2018 and the first cohort finished their first semester in December 2018.",
